ipv6AvailableInFilteredRegion.description:
True when customers in the filtered region (country + city) are offered IPv6:
Proxmox = active IPv6 prefix on a network attached to a node there;
VirtFusion/SolusVM = a node there whose platform has assign_customer_ipv6.
